{"version": 2, "width": 110, "height": 32, "title": "raidlock in 60 seconds", "env": {"TERM": "xterm-256color", "SHELL": "/bin/bash"}}
[0.129, "o", "raidlock in 60 seconds: one fictional repo, scripted stand-ins for the claude and codex CLIs, no model calls.\r\n"]
[0.129, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.129, "o", "\u001b[1m== 1. Lead opens a board; plan usage: Claude 41% of its 5h window, Codex 22%\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.885, "o", "   raid next: cart-discount -> claude (claude has 59% 5h headroom)\r\n"]
[1.887, "o", "\r\n"]
[1.887, "o", "\u001b[1m== 2. Quota: the Claude run hits its plan limit mid-quest\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[4.304, "o", "   claude-worker-cart-discount -> blocked: agent exited 1: Claude usage limit reached; resets in 3h\r\n"]
[4.382, "o", "   statusline now reports Claude at 100% of its 5h window\r\n"]
[4.382, "o", "\r\n"]
[4.382, "o", "\u001b[1m== 3. Auto-handoff: the resurrect sweep moves the quest to Codex with a resume packet\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[6.986, "o", "   cart-discount: quota on claude -> codex as res1-codex-cart-discount, now in review\r\n"]
[7.006, "o", "\r\n"]
[7.006, "o", "\u001b[1m== 4. Quota routing: new work skips Claude until its window resets\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[8.219, "o", "   raid next: receipt-tax -> codex, fallback=True (codex has 78% 5h headroom)\r\n"]
[8.221, "o", "\r\n"]
[8.221, "o", "\u001b[1m== 5. Cross-vendor review: a Claude reviewer approves the Codex patch\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[9.534, "o", "   claude-reviewer approved cart-discount\r\n"]
[9.534, "o", "\r\n"]
[9.534, "o", "\u001b[1m== 6. Receipt-gated done: refused until a signed receipt covers the integrated commit\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[10.623, "o", "   raid done -> exit 3: raidlock: cart-discount needs a valid verification receipt\r\n"]
[11.221, "o", "   verify passed=True at 457f8aca5bb4, receipt signed\r\n"]
[11.361, "o", "   cart-discount is done\r\n"]
[11.361, "o", "\r\n"]
[11.361, "o", "\u001b[1m== 7. Cost and reputation per model\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[12.57, "o", "   model               runs   tokens   usd(api)  reputation  verified\r\n"]
[12.57, "o", "   claude-opus-5-5        0        0     0.0000          50         0\r\n"]
[12.57, "o", "   claude-sonnet-5-5      1     5510     0.0135          50         0\r\n"]
[12.57, "o", "   gpt-6-astra            1    19040     0.0206         100         1\r\n"]
[12.576, "o", "\r\n"]
[12.576, "o", "Demo finished in 13s. Board: ~/demo/acme-shop\r\n"]
[12.576, "o", "Watch it: RAIDLOCK_HOME=\"~/demo/home\" raidlock ui --board \"~/demo/acme-shop\" --open\r\n"]
